# Agent entry pointers, local only.
#
# CLAUDE.md and GEMINI.md are symlinks to AGENTS.md, so each name needs its own
# entry — a symlink is matched by its own path, not by what it points at.
#
# The contract these point to, agents/agents.md, stays tracked. It is the master
# agent contract and the design system, CONTRIBUTING and the pull request
# template both bind contributors to it, and the CI workflows cite it as the
# source of the commands they run. Only the pointers are machine-local.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md